# navori golden render — engine: claude-pi-agents-md
#
# Regenerate: cd packages/cli && pnpm test:golden
# Then READ the diff: an unexplained change here is the finding.
#
# Normalized (see golden-render-tree.test.ts → NORMALIZERS):
#   (navori:managed[^\n]*?)version="[^"]*" → $1version="<VERSION>"
